---
import JourneyMap from "../../../components/JourneyMap.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getJourneyOverview } from "../../../lib/site-data";
const journey = getJourneyOverview("encoder-decoder-alignment");
---
<BaseLayout title="From source summaries to alignment — LLM Lineage" description="Two paths through conditional phrase scores, fixed source summaries and the later alignment question." eyebrow="Learning journey">
  <section class="journey-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Journey 03 · from a source to a target</p><h1>{journey.question}</h1><p class="mt-4">Start with a source phrase, a fixed-width summary and a probability for a supplied target. Then follow a deep LSTM into direct sentence generation, source reversal and a separate rescoring pipeline. Continue with Bahdanau’s weighted reads over contextual source annotations, then compare Luong’s current-state read, source windows and input feeding.</p><p class="provenance-note mt-4">All four chapters are available in both modes. Teaching order differs from posting order: Bahdanau’s first preprint precedes Sutskever’s. Stage adjacency establishes no influence arrow.</p></section>
  <section class="shell path-grid" aria-label="Choose a learning path"><article class="path-choice"><p class="kicker">Beginner · predict and explain</p><h2>Follow the source into a score.</h2><ul><li>Connect word prediction to a source-conditioned phrase.</li><li>Predict why EOS belongs in the score.</li><li>Separate reset from carrying old state.</li><li>Compare early and late reversal gaps; name the candidate source behind each result.</li><li>Predict what changes between source reads and test the uniform-weight safeguards.</li><li>Predict what a local window can omit and which summary reaches the next step.</li></ul><a class="button" href="/journeys/encoder-decoder-alignment/beginner/">Preview the beginner path</a></article><article class="path-choice"><p class="kicker">Expert · reconstruct and audit</p><h2>Bind each operation to its source.</h2><ul><li>Reconstruct vocabulary softmax and conditional likelihood.</li><li>Compare reset placement with a non-diagonal matrix.</li><li>Audit version-specific dimensions and optimization.</li><li>Audit every direct and rescoring row, with source versions and search conditions.</li><li>Reconstruct source-normalized reads and audit appendix conflicts and evaluation conditions.</li><li>Audit score shapes, source support, input feeding and translation versus alignment metrics.</li></ul><a class="button" href="/journeys/encoder-decoder-alignment/expert/">Preview the expert path</a></article></section>
  <section class="shell mt-5" aria-labelledby="alignment-stages"><p class="eyebrow">Shared corpus · four chapters available</p><h2 id="alignment-stages" class="mt-3">A teaching sequence, with chronology intact</h2><div class="mt-4"><JourneyMap journey={journey} /></div><a class="claim-link" href="/atlas/">Explore all admitted works in the atlas</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
